on) baked inside a loaf of bread. Kalakukko is especially popular in Kuopio, capital city of the Northern Savonia region. Kuopio is home to many kalakukko bakeries. The city also hosts an annual kalakukko baking contest."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-kalakukko"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kalakukko"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Finnish cuisine","cuisine/finnish-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":6,"links":[["Coregonus albula","ingredient/coregonus-albula"],["European perch","ingredient/european-perch"],["Fish fillet","ingredient/fish-fillet"],["Pork belly","ingredient/pork-belly"],["Rye flour","ingredient/rye-flour"],["Salmon","ingredient/salmon"]]},{"h":"More from Finnish cuisine","links":[["Blodpalt","dish/blodpalt"],["Cabbage roll","dish/cabbage-roll"],["Egg butter","dish/egg-butter"],["Glögg","dish/glogg"],["Joulutorttu","dish/joulutorttu"],["Karelian hot pot","dish/karelian-hot-pot"],["Kesäkeitto","dish/kesakeitto"],["Kringle","dish/kringle"],["Kuivaliha","dish/kuivaliha"],["Lanttulaatikko","dish/lanttulaatikko"],["Lohikeitto","dish/lohikeitto"],["Lörtsy","dish/lortsy"],["Semla","dish/semla"],["Smörgåstårta","dish/smorgastarta"],["Strong beer","dish/strong-beer"],["The Hoito","dish/the-hoito"]]}]},"dish/le-veau-d-or":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/le-veau-d-or","n":"Le Veau d'Or","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish found in 2 cuisines","dot":"#cf5f87","intro":[["Le Veau d'Or is a restaurant on the Upper East Side of Manhattan, serving traditional French cuisine since 1937. It is the oldest French bistro in New York City."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-le-veau-d-or"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Le_Veau_d'Or"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["French cuisine","cuisine/french-cuisine"],["New Caledonian cuisine","cuisine/new-caledonian-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Pardon Your French","ref":"site/