f0b340","intro":[["Lúc Lắc Vietnamese Kitchen, or simply Lúc Lắc, is a Vietnamese restaurant in Portland, Oregon's Leon Chung Company Building, in the United States. It opened in 2011 and has garnered a positive reception, especially for its pho and cocktails. Known as one of the city's best options for late night dining, Lúc Lắc was named one of the best Vietnamese restaurants in the United States by Thrillist in 2018."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-luc-lac-vietnamese-kitchen"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/L%C3%BAc_L%E1%BA%AFc_Vietnamese_Kitchen"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Vietnamese cuisine","cuisine/vietnamese-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Viet World Kitchen","ref":"site/vietworldkitchen-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"vietworldkitchen.com","note":"Andrea Nguyen's blog on Vietnamese cooking, ingredients and technique.","url":"https://vietworldkitchen.com/blog/category/recipes-vietnamese","suggested":true},{"name":"Hungry Huy","ref":"site/hungryhuy-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"hungryhuy.com","note":"Vietnamese-American Huy Vu's recipes for home-style Vietnamese dishes.","url":"https://www.hungryhuy.com/vietnamese/","suggested":true}]},{"h":"More from Vietnamese cuisine","links":[["Alkemē","dish/alkeme"],["Bánh bao","dish/banh-bao"],["Bánh bột lọc","dish/banh-bot-loc"],["Bánh giầy","dish/banh-giay"],["Bánh tráng","dish/banh-trang"],["Chả rươi","dish/cha-ruoi"],["Chả trứng","dish/cha-trung"],["Chạo tôm","dish/chao-tom"],["Coconut candy","dish/coconut-candy"],["Cốm","dish/com"],["Ha VL","dish/ha-vl"],["Hanoi Kitchen","dish/hanoi-kitchen"],["Indochine (restaurant)","dish/indochine-restaurant"],["Khô cá lóc","dish/kho-ca-loc"],["Lee's Sandwiches","dish/lee-s-sandwiches"],["Mắm (restaurant)","dish/mam-restaurant"],["Mắm nêm","dish/mam-nem"],["Mama Đút","dish/mama-ut"],["Matta (restaurant)","dish/matta-restaurant"],["Nước chấm","dish/nuoc-cham"],["Ốc vú nà